IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `aia-core`
IMPORT `aia-timeline`
IMPORT `aia-scope`
IMPORT `P2-section-2-gate`
IMPORT `P2-art-14`

-- Tests of P2-art-14.l4. Every expected value is written by hand from the text (the quoted line above each function), never from the code's output.
-- Argument order of a gated function: the date asked, the AI system, the harmonisation facts, then the facts of the text.

§ `Fixtures`

`Art 14 test the Annex III system` MEANS `AI system` WITH
    `date placed on the market or put into service` IS Date 2 12 2027
    `route` IS `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III`
    `significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS FALSE
`Art 14 test the Annex I system` MEANS `AI system` WITH
    `date placed on the market or put into service` IS Date 2 8 2028
    `route` IS `Route Article 6(1) and Annex I`
    `significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS FALSE
`Art 14 test the system placed earlier` MEANS `AI system` WITH
    `date placed on the market or put into service` IS Date 1 1 2027
    `route` IS `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III`
    `significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS FALSE
`Art 14 test the system placed earlier and changed` MEANS `AI system` WITH
    `date placed on the market or put into service` IS Date 1 1 2027
    `route` IS `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III`
    `significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS TRUE
`Art 14 test the system that is not high-risk` MEANS `AI system` WITH
    `date placed on the market or put into service` IS Date 2 12 2027
    `route` IS `Route neither`
    `significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS FALSE
`Art 14 test no harmonisation facts` MEANS `Arts 8 to 15 harmonisation facts` WITH
    `the products are covered by Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section B of Annex I` IS FALSE
    `Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section A of Annex I lays down requirements or obligations providing an equivalent or higher level of protection of health, safety or fundamental rights as the requirement or obligation concerned` IS FALSE
    `such limitation does not reduce the overall level of protection provided for by this Regulation` IS FALSE
`Art 14 test Section B products facts` MEANS `Arts 8 to 15 harmonisation facts` WITH
    `the products are covered by Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section B of Annex I` IS TRUE
    `Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section A of Annex I lays down requirements or obligations providing an equivalent or higher level of protection of health, safety or fundamental rights as the requirement or obligation concerned` IS FALSE
    `such limitation does not reduce the overall level of protection provided for by this Regulation` IS FALSE
`Art 14 test Section A equivalent facts` MEANS `Arts 8 to 15 harmonisation facts` WITH
    `the products are covered by Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section B of Annex I` IS FALSE
    `Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section A of Annex I lays down requirements or obligations providing an equivalent or higher level of protection of health, safety or fundamental rights as the requirement or obligation concerned` IS TRUE
    `such limitation does not reduce the overall level of protection provided for by this Regulation` IS TRUE
`Art 14 test Section A equivalent but overall protection reduced facts` MEANS `Arts 8 to 15 harmonisation facts` WITH
    `the products are covered by Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section B of Annex I` IS FALSE
    `Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section A of Annex I lays down requirements or obligations providing an equivalent or higher level of protection of health, safety or fundamental rights as the requirement or obligation concerned` IS TRUE
    `such limitation does not reduce the overall level of protection provided for by this Regulation` IS FALSE


§ `Article 14(1): effective oversight by natural persons`

-- Art 14(1) the high-risk AI system is designed and developed so that it can be effectively overseen by natural persons
-- the day before Chapter III Sections 1 to 3 apply to an Annex III system (Art 113(c)(i)): not applicable
#ASSERT `Art 14(1) the high-risk AI system is designed and developed so that it can be effectively overseen by natural persons` (Date 1 12 2027) `Art 14 test the Annex III system` `Art 14 test no harmonisation facts` TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- the day Chapter III Sections 1 to 3 begin to apply to an Annex III system
#ASSERT `Art 14(1) the high-risk AI system is designed and developed so that it can be effectively overseen by natural persons` (Date 2 12 2027) `Art 14 test the Annex III system` `Art 14 test no harmonisation facts` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- the day after
#ASSERT `Art 14(1) the high-risk AI system is designed and developed so that it can be effectively overseen by natural persons` (Date 3 12 2027) `Art 14 test the Annex III system` `Art 14 test no harmonisation facts` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- the day before Chapter III Sections 1 to 3 apply to an Annex I system (Art 113(c)(ii)): not applicable
#ASSERT `Art 14(1) the high-risk AI system is designed and developed so that it can be effectively overseen by natural persons` (Date 1 8 2028) `Art 14 test the Annex I system` `Art 14 test no harmonisation facts` TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- the day Chapter III Sections 1 to 3 begin to apply to an Annex I system
#ASSERT `Art 14(1) the high-risk AI system is designed and developed so that it can be effectively overseen by natural persons` (Date 2 8 2028) `Art 14 test the Annex I system` `Art 14 test no harmonisation facts` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- the last day of the text as enacted: Chapter III Sections 1 to 3 do not yet apply
#ASSERT `Art 14(1) the high-risk AI system is designed and developed so that it can be effectively overseen by natural persons` (Date 26 7 2026) `Art 14 test the Annex III system` `Art 14 test no harmonisation facts` TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- the first day of the text as amended: Chapter III Sections 1 to 3 do not yet apply
#ASSERT `Art 14(1) the high-risk AI system is designed and developed so that it can be effectively overseen by natural persons` (Date 27 7 2026) `Art 14 test the Annex III system` `Art 14 test no harmonisation facts` TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- Art 111(2): placed before the date of application and not significantly changed, so saved
#ASSERT `Art 14(1) the high-risk AI system is designed and developed so that it can be effectively overseen by natural persons` (Date 2 12 2030) `Art 14 test the system placed earlier` `Art 14 test no harmonisation facts` TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- Art 111(2): the same system after a significant change in its design is covered
#ASSERT `Art 14(1) the high-risk AI system is designed and developed so that it can be effectively overseen by natural persons` (Date 2 12 2030) `Art 14 test the system placed earlier and changed` `Art 14 test no harmonisation facts` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- not a high-risk AI system: no date of application, not covered
#ASSERT `Art 14(1) the high-risk AI system is designed and developed so that it can be effectively overseen by natural persons` (Date 2 12 2030) `Art 14 test the system that is not high-risk` `Art 14 test no harmonisation facts` TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- Art 2(2): an Article 6(1) system related to Section B products meets only Article 6(1), Article 60a and Articles 102 to 112
#ASSERT `Art 14(1) the high-risk AI system is designed and developed so that it can be effectively overseen by natural persons` (Date 2 8 2028) `Art 14 test the Annex I system` `Art 14 test Section B products facts` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- Art 2(2) reaches only the Article 6(1) route: an Annex III system related to Section B products is not cut off
#ASSERT `Art 14(1) the high-risk AI system is designed and developed so that it can be effectively overseen by natural persons` (Date 2 12 2027) `Art 14 test the Annex III system` `Art 14 test Section B products facts` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- Art 2(13): the application of Articles 9 to 15 may be limited where Section A legislation gives equivalent protection and the overall level is not reduced
#ASSERT `Art 14(1) the high-risk AI system is designed and developed so that it can be effectively overseen by natural persons` (Date 2 8 2028) `Art 14 test the Annex I system` `Art 14 test Section A equivalent facts` TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- Art 2(13)(b) fails (the limitation would reduce the overall level of protection): the requirement applies in full
#ASSERT `Art 14(1) the high-risk AI system is designed and developed so that it can be effectively overseen by natural persons` (Date 2 8 2028) `Art 14 test the Annex I system` `Art 14 test Section A equivalent but overall protection reduced facts` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- Art 2(13) reaches only the Article 6(1) route: an Annex III system is not limited
#ASSERT `Art 14(1) the high-risk AI system is designed and developed so that it can be effectively overseen by natural persons` (Date 2 12 2027) `Art 14 test the Annex III system` `Art 14 test Section A equivalent facts` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- every element of the text is met
#ASSERT `Art 14(1) the high-risk AI system is designed and developed so that it can be effectively overseen by natural persons` (Date 2 12 2027) `Art 14 test the Annex III system` `Art 14 test no harmonisation facts` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- not met: the high-risk AI system is designed and developed in such a way that it can be effectively overseen by natural persons during the period in which it is in use
#ASSERT `Art 14(1) the high-risk AI system is designed and developed so that it can be effectively overseen by natural persons` (Date 2 12 2027) `Art 14 test the Annex III system` `Art 14 test no harmonisation facts` FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- not met: the high-risk AI system is designed and developed with appropriate human-machine interface tools
#ASSERT `Art 14(1) the high-risk AI system is designed and developed so that it can be effectively overseen by natural persons` (Date 2 12 2027) `Art 14 test the Annex III system` `Art 14 test no harmonisation facts` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE


§ `Article 14(2): the aim of human oversight`

-- Art 14(2) human oversight aims to prevent or minimise the risks to health, safety or fundamental rights
-- the day before Chapter III Sections 1 to 3 apply to an Annex III system (Art 113(c)(i)): not applicable
#ASSERT `Art 14(2) human oversight aims to prevent or minimise the risks to health, safety or fundamental rights` (Date 1 12 2027) `Art 14 test the Annex III system` `Art 14 test no harmonisation facts` TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- the day Chapter III Sections 1 to 3 begin to apply to an Annex III system
#ASSERT `Art 14(2) human oversight aims to prevent or minimise the risks to health, safety or fundamental rights` (Date 2 12 2027) `Art 14 test the Annex III system` `Art 14 test no harmonisation facts` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- the day after
#ASSERT `Art 14(2) human oversight aims to prevent or minimise the risks to health, safety or fundamental rights` (Date 3 12 2027) `Art 14 test the Annex III system` `Art 14 test no harmonisation facts` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- the day before Chapter III Sections 1 to 3 apply to an Annex I system (Art 113(c)(ii)): not applicable
#ASSERT `Art 14(2) human oversight aims to prevent or minimise the risks to health, safety or fundamental rights` (Date 1 8 2028) `Art 14 test the Annex I system` `Art 14 test no harmonisation facts` TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- the day Chapter III Sections 1 to 3 begin to apply to an Annex I system
#ASSERT `Art 14(2) human oversight aims to prevent or minimise the risks to health, safety or fundamental rights` (Date 2 8 2028) `Art 14 test the Annex I system` `Art 14 test no harmonisation facts` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- the last day of the text as enacted: Chapter III Sections 1 to 3 do not yet apply
#ASSERT `Art 14(2) human oversight aims to prevent or minimise the risks to health, safety or fundamental rights` (Date 26 7 2026) `Art 14 test the Annex III system` `Art 14 test no harmonisation facts` TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- the first day of the text as amended: Chapter III Sections 1 to 3 do not yet apply
#ASSERT `Art 14(2) human oversight aims to prevent or minimise the risks to health, safety or fundamental rights` (Date 27 7 2026) `Art 14 test the Annex III system` `Art 14 test no harmonisation facts` TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- Art 111(2): placed before the date of application and not significantly changed, so saved
#ASSERT `Art 14(2) human oversight aims to prevent or minimise the risks to health, safety or fundamental rights` (Date 2 12 2030) `Art 14 test the system placed earlier` `Art 14 test no harmonisation facts` TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- Art 111(2): the same system after a significant change in its design is covered
#ASSERT `Art 14(2) human oversight aims to prevent or minimise the risks to health, safety or fundamental rights` (Date 2 12 2030) `Art 14 test the system placed earlier and changed` `Art 14 test no harmonisation facts` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- not a high-risk AI system: no date of application, not covered
#ASSERT `Art 14(2) human oversight aims to prevent or minimise the risks to health, safety or fundamental rights` (Date 2 12 2030) `Art 14 test the system that is not high-risk` `Art 14 test no harmonisation facts` TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- every element of the text is met
#ASSERT `Art 14(2) human oversight aims to prevent or minimise the risks to health, safety or fundamental rights` (Date 2 12 2027) `Art 14 test the Annex III system` `Art 14 test no harmonisation facts` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- not met: human oversight aims to prevent or minimise the risks to health, safety or fundamental rights that may emerge when the high-risk AI system is used in accordance with its intended purpose or under conditions of reasonably foreseeable misuse, in particular where such risks persist despite the application of other requirements set out in this Section
#ASSERT `Art 14(2) human oversight aims to prevent or minimise the risks to health, safety or fundamental rights` (Date 2 12 2027) `Art 14 test the Annex III system` `Art 14 test no harmonisation facts` FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE


