§ `Article 14(4): what the natural persons are enabled to do`

-- Art 14(4) the high-risk AI system is provided to the deployer so that the natural persons to whom human oversight is assigned are enabled to do the following
-- the day before Chapter III Sections 1 to 3 apply to an Annex III system (Art 113(c)(i)): not applicable
#ASSERT `Art 14(4) the high-risk AI system is provided to the deployer so that the natural persons to whom human oversight is assigned are enabled to do the following` (Date 1 12 2027) `Art 14 test the Annex III system` `Art 14 test no harmonisation facts` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- the day Chapter III Sections 1 to 3 begin to apply to an Annex III system
#ASSERT `Art 14(4) the high-risk AI system is provided to the deployer so that the natural persons to whom human oversight is assigned are enabled to do the following` (Date 2 12 2027) `Art 14 test the Annex III system` `Art 14 test no harmonisation facts` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- the day after
