-- the last day of the text as enacted: Chapter III Sections 1 to 3 do not yet apply
#ASSERT `Art 14(4) the high-risk AI system is provided to the deployer so that the natural persons to whom human oversight is assigned are enabled to do the following` (Date 26 7 2026) `Art 14 test the Annex III system` `Art 14 test no harmonisation facts` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- the first day of the text as amended: Chapter III Sections 1 to 3 do not yet apply
#ASSERT `Art 14(4) the high-risk AI system is provided to the deployer so that the natural persons to whom human oversight is assigned are enabled to do the following` (Date 27 7 2026) `Art 14 test the Annex III system` `Art 14 test no harmonisation facts` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- Art 111(2): placed before the date of application and not significantly changed, so saved
#ASSERT `Art 14(4) the high-risk AI system is provided to the deployer so that the natural persons to whom human oversight is assigned are enabled to do the following` (Date 2 12 2030) `Art 14 test the system placed earlier` `Art 14 test no harmonisation facts` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- Art 111(2): the same system after a significant change in its design is covered
#ASSERT `Art 14(4) the high-risk AI system is provided to the deployer so that the natural persons to whom human oversight is assigned are enabled to do the following` (Date 2 12 2030) `Art 14 test the system placed earlier and changed` `Art 14 test no harmonisation facts` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- not a high-risk AI system: no date of application, not covered
#ASSERT `Art 14(4) the high-risk AI system is provided to the deployer so that the natural persons to whom human oversight is assigned are enabled to do the following` (Date 2 12 2030) `Art 14 test the system that is not high-risk` `Art 14 test no harmonisation facts` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- every element of the text is met
#ASSERT `Art 14(4) the high-risk AI system is provided to the deployer so that the natural persons to whom human oversight is assigned are enabled to do the following` (Date 2 12 2027) `Art 14 test the Annex III system` `Art 14 test no harmonisation facts` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- not met: the high-risk AI system is provided to the deployer in such a way that the natural persons to whom human oversight is assigned are enabled, as appropriate and proportionate, to do the things listed
#ASSERT `Art 14(4) the high-risk AI system is provided to the deployer so that the natural persons to whom human oversight is assigned are enabled to do the following` (Date 2 12 2027) `Art 14 test the Annex III system` `Art 14 test no harmonisation facts` FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- not met: the natural persons are enabled, as appropriate and proportionate, to properly understand the relevant capacities and limitations of the high-risk AI system and to duly monitor its operation, including in view of detecting and addressing anomalies, dysfunctions and unexpected performance
#ASSERT `Art 14(4) the high-risk AI system is provided to the deployer so that the natural persons to whom human oversight is assigned are enabled to do the following` (Date 2 12 2027) `Art 14 test the Annex III system` `Art 14 test no harmonisation facts` TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- not met: the natural persons are enabled, as appropriate and proportionate, to remain aware of the possible tendency of automatically relying or over-relying on the output produced by the high-risk AI system (automation bias)
#ASSERT `Art 14(4) the high-risk AI system is provided to the deployer so that the natural persons to whom human oversight is assigned are enabled to do the following` (Date 2 12 2027) `Art 14 test the Annex III system` `Art 14 test no harmonisation facts` TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- not met: the natural persons are enabled, as appropriate and proportionate, to correctly interpret the output of the high-risk AI system, taking into account, for example, the interpretation tools and methods available
#ASSERT `Art 14(4) the high-risk AI system is provided to the deployer so that the natural persons to whom human oversight is assigned are enabled to do the following` (Date 2 12 2027) `Art 14 test the Annex III system` `Art 14 test no harmonisation facts` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- not met: the natural persons are enabled, as appropriate and proportionate, to decide, in any particular situation, not to use the high-risk AI system or to otherwise disregard, override or reverse its output
#ASSERT `Art 14(4) the high-risk AI system is provided to the deployer so that the natural persons to whom human oversight is assigned are enabled to do the following` (Date 2 12 2027) `Art 14 test the Annex III system` `Art 14 test no harmonisation facts` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- not met: the natural persons are enabled, as appropriate and proportionate, to intervene in the operation of the high-risk AI system or interrupt it through a 'stop' button or a similar procedure that allows the system to come to a halt in a safe state
#ASSERT `Art 14(4) the high-risk AI system is provided to the deployer so that the natural persons to whom human oversight is assigned are enabled to do the following` (Date 2 12 2027) `Art 14 test the Annex III system` `Art 14 test no harmonisation facts` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE


§ `Article 14(5): systems referred to in point 1(a) of Annex III`

