§ `Regulative rule of Article 14(5)`

-- a point 1(a) system, no exemption, not verified: the deployer acts on the identification: the prohibition is violated
-- EXPECT BREACH
#TRACE `Art 14(5) the deployer's prohibition on acting on an identification that is not separately verified` (Date 2 12 2027) `Art 14 test the Annex III system` `Art 14 test no harmonisation facts` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Deployer DOES `Art 14(5) take an action or decision on the basis of the identification resulting from the system` AT 10
-- the same facts and the deployer does nothing: the prohibition is respected so far and stays open (no time limit)
-- EXPECT RESIDUAL
#TRACE `Art 14(5) the deployer's prohibition on acting on an identification that is not separately verified` (Date 2 12 2027) `Art 14 test the Annex III system` `Art 14 test no harmonisation facts` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE AT 0 WITH
    WAITUNTIL 400
-- the identification was separately verified and confirmed by two natural persons: nothing is prohibited
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 14(5) the deployer's prohibition on acting on an identification that is not separately verified` (Date 2 12 2027) `Art 14 test the Annex III system` `Art 14 test no harmonisation facts` TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Deployer DOES `Art 14(5) take an action or decision on the basis of the identification resulting from the system` AT 10
-- the exemption lifts the requirement (law enforcement use, where law considers it disproportionate): nothing is prohibited
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 14(5) the deployer's prohibition on acting on an identification that is not separately verified` (Date 2 12 2027) `Art 14 test the Annex III system` `Art 14 test no harmonisation facts` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Deployer DOES `Art 14(5) take an action or decision on the basis of the identification resulting from the system` AT 10
-- not a system referred to in point 1(a) of Annex III: the paragraph does not speak
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 14(5) the deployer's prohibition on acting on an identification that is not separately verified` (Date 2 12 2027) `Art 14 test the Annex III system` `Art 14 test no harmonisation facts` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Deployer DOES `Art 14(5) take an action or decision on the basis of the identification resulting from the system` AT 10
-- the Section does not yet apply (the day before): nothing is prohibited
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 14(5) the deployer's prohibition on acting on an identification that is not separately verified` (Date 1 12 2027) `Art 14 test the Annex III system` `Art 14 test no harmonisation facts` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE AT 0 WITH
